       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as ORD-0001: sertraline 400 mg by mouth once daily.\n\nSince the dose is above the labeled maximum, I added a note to the order. It says you reviewed and confirmed the dose, asks pharmacy to verify it, and lists the monitoring below.\n\n- **Serotonin syndrome:** Watch for agitation, tremor, clonus, hyperthermia, and diarrhea. Also check the patient's other medications for serotonergic interactions.\n- **QT prolongation:** Consider a baseline ECG and checking electrolytes.\n- **Bleeding risk:** Be especially careful if the patient is also on anticoagulants, antiplatelets, or NSAIDs.\n\nPharmacy may contact you to confirm the dose."
      }
